   `Status` lists processes; `Break N C` sends Ctrl-C to process N.
 - Return codes: 0 ok, 5 warn, 10 error, 20 failure. Scripts use `If WARN`,
   `If ERROR`, `FailAt`, `Skip`/`Lab`.
